      "title": "WSUG: tweak Preferences info in popup menus",
      "message": "WSUG: tweak Preferences info in popup menus\n\nIn sections 6.2.2 and 6.2.3 (documenting the context menus for the\nPacket List and Packet Details panes respectively), have the description\nof _Protocol Preferences_ link to section 11.5 (Preferences), add a note\nlinking to section 11.4.1 (the Enabled Protocols dialog box) in case\nthey disable the preference in this way.\n\nIn section 11.5, document that the above-mentioned context menus allow\ndirectly opening the protocol's prefs window, setting individual prefs,\nor disabling the protocol -- again with a link to section 11.4.1.\n",
